  "details": "There are some avatars that would benefit from having multiple viewpoints with a toggle (e.g. toggling between first and third person). It would also be a huge benefit to non-humanoid avatars, like for example if your avatar has multiple heads and you want to toggle through their perspectives.\n\nCurrently though, you can only have one fixed viewpoint, and you must do some really jank stuff that just doesn't work out (the UI gets doubled and you don't see post-processing) if you want to add viewpoint toggles.",
